## 📂 7. Repository Structure

```
satquery-ai/
├── configs/                      # Model & execution configuration YAMLs
├── data/
│   └── samples/                  # Multi-band GeoTIFF, PNG, Bi-temporal, & SAR test samples
├── outputs/
│   ├── executions.jsonl          # Comprehensive 9-step audit logs & execution traces
│   └── temp_uploads/             # Normalized preview rasters
├── scripts/
│   ├── create_sample_data.py     # Deterministic sample dataset generator
│   └── run_server.py             # Hot-reloading FastAPI application runner
├── src/
│   └── satquery/
│       ├── agent/                # Multi-step Agent Planner, Intent Classifier, Executor, Synthesizer
│       ├── analysis/             # Heuristic engines (Segmentation, Detection, Grounding, Change, Fusion)
│       ├── api/                  # FastAPI REST API endpoints (/agent/analyze, /models, /capabilities)
│       ├── cli/                  # Unified CLI tool suite
│       ├── data/                 # Adapters for BigEarthNet, RSVQA, VRSBench, CDVQA
│       ├── geo/                  # Raster validation, GeoTIFF CRS extraction & normalization
│       ├── models/               # Base models, Qwen2-VL wrapper, and Model Registry
│       ├── schemas/              # Pydantic V2 schemas (Evidence, Intent, Confidence, Models)
│       ├── tools/                # Specialist tools & Tool Registry
│       ├── utils/                # Observable structured logging
│       └── vqa/                  # VQA inference engine
├── tests/                        # 114 automated pytest unit, integration & acceptance tests
├── training/
│   ├── configs/                  # LoRA training configuration
│   ├── prepare_bigearthnet_txt.py # Data preparation script
│   ├── train_lora.py             # PEFT/LoRA training runner
│   └── evaluate.py               # Benchmark evaluation script
├── web/                          # Celestial Dark-Mode Web Workspace
│   ├── index.html                # Responsive web app interface
│   ├── style.css                 # Glassmorphic UI & canvas styling
│   └── app.js                    # Multi-layer canvas rendering & live telemetry
├── pytest.ini                    # Pytest test suite configuration
├── pyproject.toml                # Project metadata & CLI entry points
├── requirements.txt              # Production & development dependencies
└── README.md                     # Project documentation
```

